flowchart TD
    A[Failure appears] --> B[Pause and preserve inputs and output]
    B --> C[Classify the failure]
    C --> D{Known-good state available?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Return to known-good state]
    D -->|No| F[Copy files and isolate the problem]
    E --> G[Change one thing]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Run a focused check]
    H --> I{Check passes?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Continue in small increments]
    I -->|No| C

